The MIT grant above covers the code, documentation, annotations, and
measurement records authored for this artifact. It does not and cannot relicense
the third-party components listed below, each of which remains under the terms
set by its own authors. Anyone redistributing or building on this repository is
responsible for complying with those terms.

Ultralytics YOLO — AGPL-3.0
    The compression and measurement code imports `ultralytics`, and the model
    weights under `weights/` were fine-tuned from Ultralytics YOLOv12
    checkpoints. Both the upstream package and works derived from its
    checkpoints are governed by the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0.
    Users who redistribute or network-deploy derivatives of those weights
    should review the AGPL-3.0 obligations, which are not waived by this file.
    https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics

External baseline models
    POSTERv2, PCNN, LANMSFF, and the improved MobileNetV3 variant are
    third-party models, reproduced here only as ONNX exports for comparison.
    Each remains under the license of its original authors. See
    docs/EXTERNAL_BASELINES.md for the provenance and export settings of each.

Datasets
    WIDER FACE and FER2013 are not redistributed in this repository. Both carry
    their own usage terms, which apply to anyone obtaining them. See
    docs/DATA.md.

The annotated multi-face stress set under `data/Stress_test/` consists of
annotations authored for this work over images drawn from the WIDER FACE test
split. The annotations are covered by the MIT grant above; the underlying
images remain subject to the WIDER FACE terms.
